B channeling implantations with various electronic stopping models
B in (100)-Si, 20 keV, 0 tilt, dose=1e13, semodel=#semodel#
 &setup    natom=3 nr=2 nion=10000 / 
 &ions     name='B' energy=20 dose=0.913e13 tilt=0 diverg=0.3 /
 &material region=1 name='SiO2' xtal='no' /
 &material region=2 name='Si' xtal='yes' wafer=0,0,1 vsurf=1,1,0 /
 &separ    atom1=1 atom2=2 semodel=#semodel# sefile='BSi.se' /
 &snpar    lstffp=f /
 &damage   fracrg=0.5 frec=0.125 damsat=4e21 /
 &geometry posif=0,10,10000000 /
 &output   lmom=t lhis=t /
